[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    107[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Two conclusions, both of which shape the Phase C assertions:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    108[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    109[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 1. **There is no ground truth to match in the UB region.** The value an OOB read
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    110[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    yields is whatever bytes neighbour `g_pow43` inside that particular shared
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    object, and the two objects have different `.rodata`/`.text` layouts. C
