[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    of the translation. Likewise, *whether* the read faults depends on where the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    115[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    object's mapping ends, which also differs (`x=4194304` above).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    116[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2. **The Rust must never reject an input the C accepts, and it does not.** Over
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    117[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    ~460 probes spanning both UB regions (curated boundaries plus randomized
