[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    122[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    is what `assert_rust_does_not_reject` enforces for every UB row.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    123[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    124[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Optimization invariance of the C ground truth
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    125[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
